BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:This is the Book Club of a Reader\, Bella: a New Moon Book Club (f
 or adults)
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260601T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260601T200000
UID:2dd4d8854c25c9bd6874e44303c9cdb7@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Book Club\, Community\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nWhether you spent 
 2009 mourning in a spinning chair or you’re just here for the wolf pack
 ’s lack of shirts\, it’s time to head back to the Pacific Northwest. J
 oin us for an adult-only deep dive into the second chapter of the Twilight
  Saga: New Moon.We’re revisiting the era of peak teenage angst with the 
 benefit of hindsight\, a bit of maturity\, and a heavy dose of side-eye.Wh
 at's on the Agenda:The Great Depression (Forks Version): We’re discussin
 g the "Empty Months\," the breakup that launched a thousand memes\, and wh
 ether Bella’s adrenaline-junkie phase was a vibe or a cry for help.The G
 low-Up of the Century: Justice for Jacob Black. We’ll discuss the sudden
  disappearance of the long wig\, the arrival of the Quileute pack\, and th
 e complicated ethics of "imprinting."The Italian Getaway: From the velvet-
 clad Volturi to the sheer logistics of a yellow Porsche 911 Turbo speeding
  through Tuscany. Was Alice the real MVP of this book? (Spoiler: Yes).Team
  Edward vs. Team Jacob: The rivalry officially begins here. Have your loya
 lties shifted now that you’re older\, or are you still waiting for a vam
 pire to watch you sleep?The Sound of Silence: Let’s celebrate the soundt
 rack that had no business being that good. From Lykke Li to Thom Yorke\, w
 e’re honoring the moody indie-rock aesthetic that defined 2009."I promis
 e that this will be the last time you’ll see me. I won’t come back. I 
 won’t put you through anything like this again. You can go on with your 
 life without any more interference from me." — Famous last words from a 
 guy who is definitely in the next book.18+ only\, please! Bring your copie
 s\, your theories\, and your best Team Edward or Team Jacob energy. 🥀 
 🌑 🐺
