 er for an insider’s look at the magic of streamside forests. Whether you
  have a sprawling acre or a cozy garden plot\, Heather will share her favo
 rite tips & tricks for using native plants to attract stunning new species
  to your property. Learn how the right tree or shrub can turn your outdoor
  space into a thriving habitat.Discover the best native plants for your so
 il 🔍🌱Learn pro-tips for attracting rare species 🦉✨Grow a legacy
 \, no matter your property size! 🌎❤️
