DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260617T200000
UID:642c0b19971a876058ec8fcac904dc96@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Community\, Gaming\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nJoin local GM Matt as
  he runs a variety of Tabletop Role Playing Games that rotate each month. 
 No experience in any system is required and anyone interested in dipping t
 heir toes into the TTRPG world are welcomed and encouraged to join in on t
 he fun!This month's game is Mothership by Tuesday Knight Games. Six months
  ago\, Greta Base ceased all communications. The Company since then has hi
 red you as part of a crew to go to Samsa VI and address the situation. You
 r mission is to get planetside\, enter Greta Base\, rendezvous with 2ndLT.
  Kaplan and re-establish satellite communications. Character sheets\, dice
 \, and pencils will be provided but feel free to bring your own material f
 rom home if you would like. Additionally\, Mothership has a companion app 
 you can download for free and create your character with the push of a but
 ton.Content Warnings: Arachnophobia\, body horror\, mind control\, violenc
 e\, and claustrophobia. Registration is required. This group is for adults
  but check our calendar for other ages!
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Study Room #119
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/tabletop-rpgs-adults-165
 126
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
