BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digging for Dinosaurs with Hands On House
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260618T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260618T140000
UID:4b1575cc29cebd24aa9dd26ee7a1b57d@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Summer Reading\, Children\n\nDig into the prehistoric p
 ast with Hands-on House! Young paleontologists will journey back in time f
 or an exciting fossil dig adventure where dinosaurs come to life. Through 
 hands-on activities\, students will explore paleontology\, geology\, and t
 he mysteries of the dinosaur age while using imagination\, observation\, a
 nd problem-solving skills to uncover clues from long ago. Get ready to dig
 \, discover\, and roar with excitement!This program is for children ages 6
 -9 years of age. Please see more information below in our policies.Registr
 ation for Digging for Dinosaurs presented by Hands on House will open at 9
 :00AM on Wednesday\, June 3rd for Manheim Township and East Lampeter resid
 ents and on Wednesday\, June 10th for residents of other municipalities.Li
 brary Program Policies Drop Off Program – This program is intended for
  children over the age of 6 years who can participate independently. Adult
 (s) must be present to check in child with youth services staff prior to p
 rogram. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.  *For children ag
 es 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; however\, a parent or caregiver
  must remain nearby and wait outside the program room for the duration
  of the program. No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registratio
 n for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from regi
 stering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please can
 cel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program 
 to allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in regis
 tration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to 
 the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The
  program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your s
 pot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry.
  If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, 
 registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past 
 the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/hold-hands-house-175350
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
