 r that birds need to thrive. You'll explore how to get started with your o
 wn bird-friendly garden with practical tips like choosing appropriate nati
 ve plants and gardening practices that invite more birds to your garden\, 
 including songbirds and hummingbirds. No matter your space or experience l
