 lian Riviera of the 1950s-- where the water is blue\, the cocktails are co
 ld\, and the motives are deadly.Join us for a special one-off book club as
  we dissect Patricia Highsmith's psychological masterpiece\, The Talented 
 Mr. Ripley. We'll discuss the book's enduring legacy\, its famous film ada
 ptations\, and why we can't help but root for literature's most charming s
 ociopath. Whether you're a longtime Highsmith fan or reading it for the fi
 rst time\, all are welcome for this one-night-only discussion!
