DESCRIPTION:Community\, Discussion\, Health & Wellness\, Adults\, Seniors\
 n\nThink your trash just sits in a hole in the ground? Think again! Join u
 s for a deep dive into the high-tech world of Lancaster's waste. Follow th
 e trail of a garbage bag from your curb to a 2\,000°F combustion chamber 
 that helps power 30\,000 local homes. We're teaming up with Lancaster Coun
 ty Solid Waste Management Authority to reveal the fascinating science of t
 urning "gross" into grid-power\, and finally settling the debate on what a
 ctually belongs in your recycling bin.
