UID:8886476ea0793ed71eaa8c26a60eb38e@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nJoin th
 e Manheim Township High School Chess Team for an exciting Summer Chess Clu
 b at the Manheim Township Public Library! Whether you're a total beginner 
 or a future grandmaster\, this is the perfect place to learn\, play\, and 
 sharpen your skills in a fun\, friendly atmosphere.🌟 All skill levels w
 elcome!♟ Ages 6-14🧠 Challenge yourself\, make new friends\, and maste
 r the game!Chess sets will be provided—just bring your love for the game
  (or your curiosity to learn)!Ready to make your move? See you there! ♟
 ✨Registration for Summer Chess Club will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, J
 une 17th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday
 \, June 24th for residents of other municipalities.Library Program Policie
 sNo Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 
 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future
  programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrat
 ions at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those
  on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status
 .Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the prog
 ram to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin p
 romptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited
  to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, re
 gistrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not 
 be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Drop Off P
 rogram – This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years w
 ho can participate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in chi
 ld with youth services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed 
 in the event space. *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\
 ; however\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the 
 program room for the duration of the program.In accordance with library po
 licy\, children ages 8 and up may be in the library unaccompanied.Designat
 ed Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your regis
 tration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellations- P
 lease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has n
 ot been cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code 
 of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (
 including children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the
  consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/do-not-publish-summer-ch
 ess-club-161038
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
