 ive show brings to life many of the important places\, heroic people and f
 oundational documents that forged our nation. George Washington\, Betsy Ro
 ss\, Paul Revere\, the Declaration of Independence\, the Liberty Bell and 
 the history of our American Flags all come to life through magic! All ages
 .
