BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nick DiSanto One Man Band Pre-4th of July Celebration
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T133000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260702T150000
UID:321898f6126c39a7d9e0813ca6a3b569@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Music\, Summer Reading\, Toddlers\, Children\, Tweens\, Adults
 \n\nBring your young patriots and join us for a fun\, musical event with a
  whole lot of American pride! Let's kick off the pre-4th of July celebrati
 ons in style and create lasting memories for our little ones as we honor t
 he land of the free and the home of the brave. Wear your red\, white\, or 
 blue attire as we begin our program with "Stars and Stripes" craft station
 s\, where kids can create their own patriotic masterpieces. Then at 2:00 p
 m\, dance and sing with American favorites and more performed by Nick DiSa
 nto One Man Band. With a unique setup featuring a combination of instrumen
 ts\, including guitar\, harmonica\, foot percussion. Nick's music celebrat
 es the roots of American culture and will delight every generation.​Regi
 stration for Nick DiSanto One Man Band will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, 
 June 17th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesda
 y\, June 24th for residents of other municipalities.Registration Requireme
 nts – To help us manage our space\, please register every person who wil
 l be attending\, including adults or siblings.Library Policies:*For the sa
 fety and supervision of all participants: Children under 8 years old must 
 be accompanied by an adult throughout the program. Children ages 8 and old
 er are welcome to attend the program independently.  No Show – Patrons f
 ailing to cancel their registration for more than 2 library programs in a 
 month will be restricted from registering for future programs for a period
  of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrations at least 2 hours 
 prior to the start of the program to allow for those on the waiting list t
 o be notified of their change in registration status.Late Arrivals – Ple
 ase arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the program to allow for parki
 ng and other circumstances. The program will begin promptly at the designa
 ted time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited to those on the wait 
 list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, registrants may be allow
 ed into the program. However\, registrants will not be permitted to enter 
 the program 5 minutes past the start time.Photography - The Manheim Townsh
 ip Public Library Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video 
 recording individuals (including children) without their consent (or in th
 e case of a child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).Cancellations- Pl
 ease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has no
 t been cancelled.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/nick-disanto-one-man-ban
 d-pre-4th-july-celebration-161267
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
