UID:3b0debee7e1cc72ea0fc5105fef1a3a9@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Gaming\, Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nJoin th
 e Manheim Township High School Chess Team for an exciting Summer Chess Clu
 b at the Manheim Township Public Library! Whether you're a total beginner 
 or a future grandmaster\, this is the perfect place to learn\, play\, and 
 sharpen your skills in a fun\, friendly atmosphere.🌟 All skill levels w
 elcome!♟ Ages 6-14🧠 Challenge yourself\, make new friends\, and maste
 r the game!Chess sets will be provided—just bring your love for the game
  (or your curiosity to learn)!Ready to make your move? See you there! ♟
 ✨Registration for Summer Chess Club will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, J
 uly 1st for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\
 , July 8th for residents of other municipalities.Library Program PoliciesN
 o Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 li
 brary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future p
 rograms for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registratio
 ns at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those o
 n the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration status.L
 ate Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progra
 m to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pro
 mptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited t
 o those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, regi
 strants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not be
  permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Drop Off Pro
 gram – This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years who
  can participate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child
  with youth services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in
  the event space. *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; 
 however\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the pr
 ogram room for the duration of the program.In accordance with library poli
 cy\, children ages 8 and up may be in the library unaccompanied.Designated
  Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your registr
 ation. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellations- Ple
 ase check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has not
  been cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code of
  Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (in
 cluding children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the c
 onsent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/do-not-publish-summer-ch
 ess-club-161040
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
