DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\n\nAll aboard for a journey
  into the world of railroads! The Railroad Museum of Pennsylvania is bring
 ing its engaging Workin’ on the Railroad program to our library this sum
 mer. Families are invited to explore the fascinating jobs that kept the tr
 ains running—from conductors and engineers to signalmen and porters.Part
 icipants will get hands-on with real railroad tools\, lanterns\, uniform i
 tems\, dining car china\, ticket punches\, and more! This interactive prog
