 ose same creatures. Be it land\, air or sea… “The BugMan” has experi
 enced a lifetime of travel and unusual experiences that will educate and e
 ntertain everyone. Insects are the most important part of the ecosystem an
 d critical to the survival of nearly everything on the Planet!Appropriate 
