SUMMARY:Dinosaur Discovery by Lancaster County Parks
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260721T113000
UID:d0976d22fa1d24597244fd44a39dd2a3@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Summer Reading\, Children\, Tweens\, Teens\n\nCome make a dino
 saur discovery 🦕and create a story that fits its life. The Naturalist w
 ill tell the beginning of a dinosaur story. When the Naturalist stops in t
 he middle of the story the participants will be asked to hunt for and find
  the parts of dinosaurs hidden in the area. As they find the parts\, the g
 roup will be challenged to piece the dinosaur back together.🦖 Each grou
 p acts out an end to the story using the dinosaur they have found\, making
  the story appropriate to the life of the dinosaur they have pieced togeth
 er. Afterwards\, we will use a silly facts activity to challenge everyone
 ’s dinosaur expertise.Registration for Dinosaur Discovery by Lancaster C
 ounty Park will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, July 8th for Manheim Townshi
 p and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, July 15th for residents o
 f other municipalities. Registration Requirements – To help us manage ou
 r space\, please register every person who will be attending\, including a
 dults or siblings. Cancellations- Please check your email prior to departi
 ng to verify that the program has not been cancelled. Library Program Poli
 cies   No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more
  than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from registering fo
 r future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your r
 egistrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow t
 hose on the waiting list to be notified of their change in registration st
 atus. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start 
 of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program w
 ill begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will b
 e forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots 
 remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrant
 s will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start 
 time. Accompanying Adults – This program is for adults and children to
  enjoy together. Please plan to attend and be engaged with your child. Dro
 p offs will not be permitted. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Li
 brary Code of Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording in
 dividuals (including children) without their consent (or in the case of a 
 child\, the consent of a parent or guardian).
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center ABC
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/dinosaur-discovery-lanca
 ster-county-parks-170768
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
