 r the game!Chess sets will be provided—just bring your love for the game
  (or your curiosity to learn)!Ready to make your move? See you there! ♟
 ✨Registration for Cissy and the Man will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, J
 uly 8th for Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\
 , July 15th for residents of other municipalities.Library Program Policies
 No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registration for more than 2 l
 ibrary programs in a month will be restricted from registering for future 
 programs for a period of one month’s time. Please cancel your registrati
 ons at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program to allow for those 
