 Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to the start of the progr
 am to allow for parking and other circumstances. The program will begin pr
 omptly at the designated time. At this time\, your spot will be forfeited 
 to those on the wait list who will be granted entry. If spots remain\, reg
 istrants may be allowed into the program. However\, registrants will not b
 e permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past the start time.Drop Off Pr
 ogram – This program is intended for children over the age of 6 years wh
 o can participate independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in chil
 d with youth services staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed i
 n the event space. *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\;
  however\, a parent or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the p
 rogram room for the duration of the program.In accordance with library pol
 icy\, children ages 8 and up may be in the library unaccompanied.Designate
 d Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions designated on your regist
 ration. Only children in that age range will be admitted.Cancellations- Pl
 ease check your email prior to departing to verify that the program has no
 t been cancelled. Photography - The Manheim Township Public Library Code o
 f Conduct Policy prohibits photographing or video recording individuals (i
 ncluding children) without their consent (or in the case of a child\, the 
 consent of a parent or guardian).
