BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Cartooning Made Easy!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T190000
UID:921a4a34fcccd0d708227ffa4f624e6f@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:Arts & Crafts\, Summer Reading\, Teens\, Adults\, Seniors\n\nA
 ttendees will be instructed on the basics of cartooning so they can carica
 ture the world around them and create original cartoons as well as draw th
 eir favorite cartoon characters.Ed has drawn for The Walt Disney Company\,
  Warner Bros. Studios\, Don Bluth Animation Studios\, Hanna Barbera Studio
 s\, Hyperion Studios\, Filmation Studios\, Ross Bagdasarian Productions\, 
 Calabash Animation Studios\, K.C.M.P. Productions\, and numerous independe
