 100 of these cold-blooded creatures. Come laugh and learn with Jesse and h
 is scaley sidekicks\, and check out some animal books\, too!Appropriate fo
 r all ages.*For the safety and supervision of all participants: Children u
 nder 8 years old must be accompanied by an adult throughout the program. C
 hildren ages 8 and older are welcome to attend the program independently. 
