UID:d1c6445b67ae05aaa44ff2454417ec0c@calendar.lancasterlibraries.org
DESCRIPTION:STEM\, Children\n\nJoin us as we learn how to make ice cream -
  the STEM way!  We'll explore different ingredients\, different flavors\, 
 and different ice cream making techniques.  I scream\, you scream\, we'll 
 all be screaming for ice cream! 🍨🍦This program is for kids ages 6 - 
 9 years old. Designated Ages – Please adhere to the age restrictions d
 esignated on your registration. Only children in that age range will be ad
 mitted.   Registration will open at 9:00AM on Wednesday\, August 5th f
 or Manheim Township and East Lampeter residents and on Wednesday\, August 
 12th for residents of other municipalities.Drop Off Program – This pro
 gram is intended for children over the age of 6 years who can participate 
 independently. Adult(s) must be present to check in child with youth servi
 ces staff prior to program. Adults will not be allowed in the event space.
 *For children ages 6–7\, this is a drop-off program\; however\, a pare
 nt or caregiver must remain nearby and wait outside the program room f
 or the duration of the program. Cancellations- Please check your email pri
 or to departing to verify that the program has not been cancelled. Library
  Program Policies No Show – Patrons failing to cancel their registrati
 on for more than 2 library programs in a month will be restricted from reg
 istering for future programs for a period of one month’s time. Please ca
 ncel your registrations at least 2 hours prior to the start of the program
  to allow those on the waiting list to be notified of their change in regi
 stration status. Late Arrivals – Please arrive 10 minutes prior to
  the start of the program to allow for parking and other circumstances. Th
 e program will begin promptly at the designated time. At this time\, your 
 spot will be forfeited to those on the wait list who will be granted entry
 . If spots remain\, registrants may be allowed into the program. However\,
  registrants will not be permitted to enter the program 5 minutes past
  the start time.
LOCATION:Manheim Township\, MTP Morgan Center A
URL:https://calendar.lancasterlibraries.org/event/stem-ice-cream-173945
X-SOURCE:Lancaster Libraries
END:VEVENT
